---
title: Sponsors
description: "Sponsor Team 1102. See our giving levels, from Apprentice to Dragon, and the businesses and families who make the team possible."
permalink: /sponsors/
---
<section class="pagehead">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>Sponsors</h1>
    <p>Sponsorship pays for parts, tools, event registration, and travel. It also puts your name in front of the students and families of {{ site.region }}.</p>
  </div>
</section>
<div class="teeth teeth--moss" aria-hidden="true"></div>

<section class="band">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>Our sponsors</h2>
    <p class="soft wall__intro">Thank you to everyone who backs the team.</p>
    <div class="wall">
      {% if sponsors.tiers | hasSponsors %}
        {% for t in sponsors.tiers | byMinDesc %}
          {% if t.sponsors.length %}
          {# Tiles per row by level, lowest level first: wide rows for top levels, more per row lower down. #}
          {% set cols = [5, 5, 5, 4, 3, 3, 2, 1][loop.revindex - 1] %}
          <div class="wall__tier" style="--rank: {{ loop.revindex }}; --cols: {{ cols }}; --cols-sm: {{ 1 if cols < 4 else 2 }}">
            <h3 class="wall__label">{{ t.name }}</h3>
            <ul>
              {% for s in t.sponsors %}
              <li>
                {% if s.url %}<a href="{{ s.url }}" rel="noopener" target="_blank">{% endif %}
                {% if s.logo %}<img src="{{ ('/assets/img/sponsors/' + s.logo) | url }}" alt="{{ s.name }}" width="{{ s.width }}" height="{{ s.height }}" loading="lazy">{% else %}<span class="name">{{ s.name }}</span>{% endif %}
                {% if s.url %}</a>{% endif %}
              </li>
              {% endfor %}
            </ul>
          </div>
          {% endif %}
        {% endfor %}
      {% else %}
      <div class="empty">
        <h3>This wall is waiting for its first name</h3>
        <p>Every sponsor who joins appears here, with a logo size that grows with their level. Yours could be the first.</p>
        <a class="btn btn--moss" href="{{ links.sponsor }}">Become a sponsor</a>
      </div>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band band--fog2">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>Giving levels</h2>
    <p class="soft wall__intro">Eight levels, named for the ranks of a wizard's career. Every gift helps, and higher levels appear larger on this site.</p>
    <ul class="levels">
      {% for t in sponsors.tiers | byMinDesc %}
      <li>
        <h3>{{ t.name }}</h3>
        <p class="range">{{ t.range }}</p>
        <p class="recognition">{{ t.recognition }}</p>
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band cta">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>Become a sponsor</h2>
    <p>Email us to choose a level, or to offer tools, materials, or mentor time instead of a gift.</p>
    <div class="btn-row">
      <a class="btn btn--moss" href="{{ links.sponsor }}">{% if site.donateUrl %}Give now{% else %}Email about sponsoring{% endif %}</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
